{"t":"Crystal Gardens (Book)","s":"crystal-gardens-book-df300","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Paper_f21cd5.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Paper\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Paper_f21cd5.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Gardens\">Crystal Gardens</a>, inside a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pile%20of%20Bones%20%28Quest%29\">Pile of Bones (Quest)</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31976,32908,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31976, 32908, 8)</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">An explorer is ecstatic about reaching the <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Gardens\">Crystal Gardens</a> and then sees his friend Harry do something strange.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Gardens\">Crystal Gardens</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-cursed-crystal-quest\">The Cursed Crystal Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Nargor Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/>December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Perhaps it can be useful to you somehow.Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-cursed-crystal-quest\">The Cursed Crystal Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>I did it! I reached the crystal gardens! What beauty and splendor I have seen down there. Even more: I discovered a small subterranean lake - but Harry was there before me. And he did something strange: He ringed a small, transparent looking bell and immediatly a big whirl appeared in the water. I suppose this is the mysterious way deeper into the caves we sought after for so long. But Harry, the coward, didn't dare to dive into the water. Instead he left the caverns and heeded back to the surface. I have to go after him tomorrow. I must have this bell!</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-cursed-crystal-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-cursed-crystal-quest","quest":"The Cursed Crystal Quest","step":"2-2","n":7,"title":"(Opcional) Ler o papel dos Crystal Gardens","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":31976,"y":32908,"z":8,"label":"Pile of Bones com o papel (opcional)"}]}],"spots":[{"x":31976,"y":32908,"z":8,"text":"Crystal Gardens , inside a Pile of Bones (Quest) here ."}]}}